### 1. Setup: Create a Location
POST http://localhost:8888/api/locations/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "loc":"A-01"
}

### 2. Setup: Create a Product
POST http://localhost:8888/api/products/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "TEST-001",
    "name": "Test Chip",
    "category": "Electronics",
    "description": "High quality capacitor"
}

### 3. Logistics: Receive Goods (Add to Stock)
POST http://localhost:8888/api/logistics/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "TEST-001",
    "loc": "A-01",
    "qty": 50
}

### 4 Logistics: Check available Product
GET http://localhost:8888/api/logistics/stock/TEST-001


### 5. Logistics: Issue Goods (FIFO Test)
POST http://localhost:8888/api/logistics/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "TEST-001",
    "qty": 20
}

### 6. Verify: Check Total Stock
GET http://localhost:8888/api/products/test
